  </div><div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-quiz>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-quiz>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p></div>

  <h2>Build three calibrated evaluations from shuffled chunks</h2><div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="practice" data-tile-builder data-answer="The measured noise reduction is substantial but the overall evidence remains limited" data-hint="State the strong measured result before contrasting it with the broader evidence limit." data-fix="The measured noise reduction is substantial, but the overall evidence remains limited." data-success-message="Correct. The sentence separates a substantial measured result from limited overall evidence."><h3>1. Result and evidence boundary</h3><p>Evaluate the sound result without turning it into total program success.</p><div class="build-bank" data-build-bank><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="The measured">The measured</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="noise reduction">noise reduction</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="is substantial">is substantial</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="but">but</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="the overall evidence">the overall evidence</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="remains limited">remains limited</button></div><div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap chunks to build the evaluation."></div><div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-build>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-build>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p></div>
  <div class="practice" data-tile-builder data-answer="The sample is too small to support a general claim" data-hint="Build the sample evaluation, exceeded limit, and unsupported result in that order." data-fix="The sample is too small to support a general claim." data-success-message="Correct. Too small is anchored to the specific consequence that a general claim is unsupported."><h3>2. Excess and consequence</h3><p>Explain why a small sample cannot support broad generalization.</p><div class="build-bank" data-build-bank><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="The sample">The sample</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="is too small">is too small</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="to support">to support</button><button class="build-tile" data-build-tile="a general claim">a general claim</button></div><div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap chunks to build the evidence limit."></div><div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-build>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-build>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p></div>
